  "prompt": "Users report the following problem with the product:\n\ncount secondary adapters parked mid-reconnect in the scale-to-zero gate\n\n_handle_profile_adapter_fatal_error pops a failed secondary adapter out of\n_profile_adapters and parks it in _profile_failed_platforms while\n_run_secondary_profile_reconnect retries (e.g. a Photon SIDECAR_FAILED with\nretryable=True). The gate unioned config.platforms, self.adapters and\n_profile_adapters only, so during that window a relay-fronted launch profile\nlooked relay-only and the watcher could suspend the process; the reconnect\nthen never completed. Union the platform keys of every\n_profile_failed_platforms entry as well: a pending reconnect is still a\nserved direct connection.\n\nExtends the existing secondary-adapter gate test with the parked case\n(red on the previous head, green with this change).\n\nFind the cause in the source code and fix it. Do not add or change tests; the fix will be judged by tests you cannot see. You can run the existing tests with `python -m pytest <path>`. Stop when the fix is done."
 },
